sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Bank as Bank / SePay
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>webhook edge
  participant Payment as Payment<br/>webhook service
  participant PDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Payment DB
  participant Order as Order<br/>bill owner
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>payment.completed

  Bank->>BFF: POST tenant SePay webhook
  BFF->>Payment: tenantSlug, secret, payload
  Payment->>Payment: Verify tenant secret<br/>and extract QRTBL reference

  alt Invalid secret or tenant mismatch
    Payment-->>BFF: Reject before mutation
    BFF-->>Bank: Error response
  else No payable QRTBL transfer
    Payment-->>BFF: success without mutation
    BFF-->>Bank: success
  else Matched pending payment
    Payment->>PDB: Lock payment by reference

    alt Duplicate, after-paid, or underpaid
      Payment->>PDB: Save audit only
      Payment-->>BFF: success
    else Amount is sufficient
      Payment->>PDB: Save PAID VietQR<br/>metadata + outbox
      PDB-->>Payment: Commit Payment transaction
      Payment->>Order: BILL_MARK_PAID
      Payment-->>Kafka: Publish payment.completed
    end

    Payment-->>BFF: success
    BFF-->>Bank: success
  end

  Note over Payment,PDB: Duplicate, after-paid, and underpaid webhooks are audited<br/>but they do not complete the bill again
